      556   ON CHOOSE OF B-hist IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
      557   DO:
      558     define variable v-rid-list as character no-undo.
      559     if NOT available locked_dis-rule then return no-apply.
      560     run ref/discruls.w (
      561                      INPUT parParentProc
      562                     ,input "":U
      563                     ,input "rl-root":U
      564                     ,input tt-dis-rule.rule-num
      565                     ,input tt-dis-rule.upper-rule-num
      566                     ,input "":U
